<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: HORSE RACING-DESERT KING WINS IRISH DERBY.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-DESERT KING WINS IRISH DERBY.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Desert King, ridden by Christy</p>
<p>Roache, won the Irish Derby horse race at The Curragh on Sunday.</p>
</text>
